oExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <h1 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"86\" class=\"\"><span data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"84\">Ubiquiti UniFi U6-Pro – 5.3 Gbps WiFi 6 Access Point for Ultra-Fast Connectivity</span></h1>\n<p data-start=\"88\" data-end=\"469\" class=\"\">The <span data-start=\"92\" data-end=\"117\">Ubiquiti UniFi U6-Pro</span> is a powerful <span data-start=\"132\" data-end=\"166\">WiFi 6 (802.11ax) access point</span>, delivering <span data-start=\"179\" data-end=\"217\">blazing-fast speeds up to 5.3 Gbps</span> for <span data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"272\">seamless, high-performance wireless networking</span>. Ideal for <span data-start=\"284\" data-end=\"353\">businesses, offices, hotels, cafes, and high-density environments</span>, the U6-Pro ensures <span data-start=\"374\" data-end=\"428\">low-latency, high-speed, and reliable connectivity</span> with <span data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"466\">MU-MIMO and OFDMA technology</span>.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"494\" class=\"\"><span data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"492\">Key Features:</span></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1334\"><li><span data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"534\">Ultra-Fast 5.3 Gbps WiFi 6 Speeds</span> – Supports <span data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"558\">4x4 MIMO</span> for faster and more efficient connections<br data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"603\">\n</li><li><span data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"631\">Dual-Band Connectivity</span> – Up to <span data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"679\">600 Mbps (2.4GHz) + 4.8 Gbps (5GHz)</span> for maximum performance<br data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"706\">\n</li><li><span data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"736\">Advanced OFDMA &amp; MU-MIMO</span> – Handles multiple devices simultaneously without slowdowns<br data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"799\">\n</li><li><span data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"844\">Seamless Integration with UniFi Network</span> – Easily managed via the <span data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"899\">UniFi Network Application</span><br data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"902\">\n</li><li><span data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"941\">Compact, Weather-Resistant Design</span> – Suitable for <span data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"988\">indoor and semi-outdoor use</span><br data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"991\">\n</li><li><span data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1019\">PoE+ Support (802.3at)</span> – Simplified installation with <span data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1074\">Power over Ethernet</span></li></ul>\n<p data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1448\" class=\"\"><br></p><p data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1448\" class=\"\">Upgrade your <span data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1382\">network with the UniFi U6-Pro</span> and experience <span data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1445\">next-level speed, security, and scalability</span>.</p><p><br></p><p><b>Build Features:</b></p><p><img style=\"width: 50%;\" src=\"/image/catalog/Ubiquiti/u6-pro-info-1.png\"><img style=\"width: 50%;\" src=\"/image/catalog/Ubiquiti/u6-pro-info-2.png\"><img style=\"width: 50%;\" src=\"/image/catalog/Ubiquiti/u6-pro-info-3.png\"><b><br></b></p><h5><b>Deployment and Mounting:</b></h5><p><img style=\"width: 985px;\" src=\"/image/catalog/Ubiquiti/images_svc_ui_default_51.png\"><br></p><p><img style=\"width: 100%;\" src=\"/image/catalog/Ubiquiti/images_svc_ui_default_52.png\"><img style=\"width: 985px;\" src=\"/image/catalog/Ubiquiti/images_svc_ui_default_53.png\"><br></p>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Ruijie RG-RAP6262(G) AX1800 Dual Band Outdoor Wi-Fi6 Access Point","href":"/ruijie-rg-rap6262g-ax1800-dual-band-outdoor-wi-fi6-access-point","now":"25,000৳","old":"26,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Ubiquiti UniFi UAP-AC-LR 1317Mbps Dual-Band Long-Range Access Point","href":"/ubiquiti-uap-ac-lr-access-point","now":"11,500৳","old":"12,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Cambium XV2-21X Wi-Fi 6 Indoor Enterprise Wireless Acce